    "text": "The charge flowing in a conductor changes with time as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;are constants. Minimum value of current is:"
